/*
Package cn4log exposes an API to log your work.

first, instanitiate a logger with cn4log.New, and giving it a threshold level.
Messages of lesser criticality won't be logged.

Sharing the logger is the responsebility of the caller.

The logger can be called to log messages on four levels:
    - Debug: mostly used to debug code, follow step-by-step processes
    - Info: valuable messages providing insights to the milestones of a processes
    - Warn: critical status that still can be handled by the processes
    - Error: error messages to understand what went wrong
*/
package cn4log
